00:06:43.435 --> 00:06:46.172
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:06:46.771 --> 00:06:51.740
<v Slow>2000円のルールはいつ始まりますか？

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.403
<v Host>When does the two thousand yen rule start? June first.

00:06:57.004 --> 00:07:01.995
<v Slow>ゴミを捨てると、いくら払いますか？

00:07:02.795 --> 00:07:06.564
<v Host>How much do you pay if you throw trash? Two thousand yen.

00:07:07.163 --> 00:07:12.684
<v Slow>現金がなくても、払うことができますか？

00:07:13.483 --> 00:07:18.764
<v Host>Can you pay without cash? Yes — smartphone or card is also possible.

00:07:19.363 --> 00:07:31.747
<v Host>That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

00:07:32.348 --> 00:07:34.603
<v News>また明日。
